# Configuration overview only: do not copy this file into every service.
# Copy each service/.env.example to service/.env instead.
# Frontend: 3001; API: 3000; hooks: 3002.
# Database URL must identify the same database in API, hooks, and processor.
# KAFKA_TOPIC must match between processor and worker.
# Current message contract remains on zap-events; versioned messages are a later change.
# Set JWT_PASSWORD and SMTP credentials before starting their services.
# Never commit real .env files or credentials.
